## Purpose

The owner now requests categorizing all eligible food photographs in the supplied
posts directory and its subfolders, then adding reviewed derivatives to the six
website notebooks. This expands the earlier shortlist-only request.

## Owner category rules

- Happy birthday written on a cake: Birthday Cakes.
- Lots of visible cream/cherries: Cream cakes.
- Character design or extensive decorative props: Decorated cakes.
- Visually uniced cake: Tea cakes.
- Doll cake: Doll cakes.
- Remaining eligible food: Chocolates.
- Ignore non-food images.

These are appearance-based rules, not proof of ingredients or dietary properties.
Record overlapping or unclear cues for focused review instead of guessing from
filenames. Existing original photographs and provenance must remain unchanged.

